Comment: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:10.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's... raining...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.23,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:15.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:17.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't slack off just because it's raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:19.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to collect more konpeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.39,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:39.73,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,You got me covered in mud!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:17.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's okay if you get dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The rain will just wash it all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:22.30,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.48,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I'm all wet now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.10,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:31.17,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.34,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:43.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.43,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:47.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:55.26,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:01.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,B-But, it's not a problem if I live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:04.86,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't mind, then of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.41,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take a look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:08.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:13.72,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Allow me to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:18.69,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Her name is Chitose. She's a friend of mine, and works as the landlady here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:20.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:21.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.85,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:26.68,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Pleasure to meet you. I'm Chitose Mihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:31.43,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,If you're ever in need of\Nsomething, don't hesitate to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:32.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.98,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose, mind if I leave the rest to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.15,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:39.18,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I have to get back to the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A-All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll stop by later to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:48.97,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like Sayaka hasn't changed.\NShe's always worrying about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:51.44,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:52.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:54.58,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:58.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,She looks really nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:00.92,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,This is where you say, "I'm looking forward to it"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:04.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I hope you're looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:05.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:07.85,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,You got it the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.91,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know when your luggage will arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:12.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is all I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.91,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,But what about your bedsheets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:18.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't own any!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:19.61,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:22.68,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let me show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:24.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:28.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This place looks really nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.03,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:36.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What a great room, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:40.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:44.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.27,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:56.25,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you leave me behind...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.19,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I've told you so many times! In this world, I'm nothing but a stuffed animal!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:04.14,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:07.54,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.39,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery opens soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:16.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I totally forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:20.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:21.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry! Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.26,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:33.39,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,But look at your stuffed animal...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:37.81,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, it's all covered in mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:41.43,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:43.83,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:45.42,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,All clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:46.88,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:47.70,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.46,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot more considerate than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.00,Default,Saya,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:02.73,Default,Saya,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:06.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I loved it! There's a roof, and it's really relaxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:09.00,Default,Saya,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.24,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:16.02,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I'm cleaning right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:20.16,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Then we'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:21.65,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:23.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:25.77,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:26.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:28.21,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:32.16,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't have to provide her with an apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:36.01,Default,Saya,0000,0000,0000,,But it seems like everyone's excited to have her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:38.05,Default,Saya,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be mean to her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:40.48,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,How many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.31,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,How many times have you been betrayed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:51.49,Default,Saya,0000,0000,0000,,I can see where you're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:57.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You should be cautious of everyone around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:03.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good thing it stopped raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery's closed tomorrow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to work hard to gather konpeito, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:25.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was sunny until just a little while ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.07,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to bring an umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:30.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:36.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't look like it'll stop anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.95,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we'll just have to walk in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:42.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that's not fair! You don't even have to get wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.47,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you didn't bring an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:47.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:48.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Then here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.97,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Please use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:56.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:57.97,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's yours to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.73,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's here for the customers anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:03.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:06.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come return it when it stops raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.05,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.01,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:11.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:18.97,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,You were able to hold a decent conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.98,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,So, just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look for people who need to be healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:29.70,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you're right in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.91,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,After all, it's a place that a lot of people visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:48.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:51.92,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:54.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The umbrella's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:54.88,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:58.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps someone took it, thinking it was theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:00.51,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,It was probably on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:04.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Are you allowed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:06.00,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:13.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was something I borrowed too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:16.72,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:20.03,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We bumped into each other yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:23.48,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone took my umbrella...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.15,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.95,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You can use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:36.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.26,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.13,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I live right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:42.56,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, if you don't have an umbrella, you'll get your stuffed animal wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:43.36,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:54.28,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't snack too much or you're gonna get fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:58.71,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.53,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I hate you, Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:01.93,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:03.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.84,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't wait up, I'm going to hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.19,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You'll hit me either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:10.54,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:12.20,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:15.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So there are also people who are willing to give up their umbrella,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,even if it means they're going to get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:39.54,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:41.61,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:45.74,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a mark on your face from the floor mat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:52.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,H-Have a nice day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That was so embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:55.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it made a mark on my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:59.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I bet Miss Chitose thinks I'm a total freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:04.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:05.64,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:09.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot for the umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:11.94,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised you knew which school I went to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:12.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:17.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,when I went to the cake shop to apologize for the umbrella,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:20.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,he told me that this was the only\Nschool with a green sailor uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:24.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi was really thankful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.95,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:26.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:28.90,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is that the name of your stuffed animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.89,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kind of a weird name, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:35.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.62,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Mutsumi Tadokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:38.63,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.64,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Your hair's stickin' up in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:45.33,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.64,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.34,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,W-Where is it sticking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It looks fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:55.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a mark on my face from sleeping on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:59.74,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't exactly make me feel any better...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:04.58,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let it get to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.70,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I've got morning practice. Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:14.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You know, that boy from earlier is kind of mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He reminds me of Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:21.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He'll say mean things to me if I'm late again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:28.98,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You were a minute and 23 seconds late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:32.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,O-One minute?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.31,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, you're still late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.49,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You probably slept until the last minute possible, didn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:43.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The floor mark already wore off...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.52,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you rolled out of your sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:48.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't own any!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:49.26,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.62,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.51,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Did Kiyokazu say something mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:00.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:05.12,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,He can be a bit blunt, but he's not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:07.93,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,But if he does bully you, just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:10.37,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give him a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:13.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,B-Beating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.86,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, just like in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Old days...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:21.69,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Help me air the sheets for the kids to nap in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:23.57,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It finally stopped raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.88,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:34.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bye! See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.34,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we'll be seeing more rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:42.63,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Do you carry an umbrella, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:46.81,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,But you do, right, Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:48.36,Default,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you walk her home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.66,Default,Kiyo,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something to do after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.85,Default,Kiyo,0000,0000,0000,,Just take my umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:55.19,Default,Kiyo,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I'd hate to have to share an umbrella with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sharing an umbrella...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.04,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,It's when couples walk under the same umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:08.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:11.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It really started to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:26.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The person who took it by\Nmistake came and put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:29.45,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.23,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,I've been seeing you everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi Tadokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:35.47,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Just call me Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.47,0:14:36.48,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,So what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:38.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I got the umbrella back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:43.07,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:47.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you here to shop again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:48.43,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:52.03,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Fencing practice is really intense and it makes me hungry afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.23,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:00.25,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get fat if I eat too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:02.08,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,...so you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.38,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.44,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.55,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:34.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They're sharing an umbrella, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:16:00.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi looked really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:04.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what I could do to cheer her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:06.62,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:08.28,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,This is going to be a bit difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:14.00,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.95,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Please, open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:20.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:29.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you two all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:30.37,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.81,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the ruckus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:37.28,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Chiho, the manager's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:38.43,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Chise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Pleasure to meet you. I'm Kobato Hanato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.99,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You don't own any bedsheets, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:45.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:48.82,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Mom told us to bring you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:50.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:53.12,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,It's a hand-me-down, if you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:55.52,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:04.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They gave me sheets!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.33,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to be the healer, not the one being healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:10.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:13.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to cheer Mutsumi up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:15.22,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:18.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I'll just do whatever I have to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.52,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:29.62,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's better to leave her be for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:35.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.36,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:40.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I need to talk to you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:42.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,About Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:50.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:53.25,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:54.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:57.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to share an\Numbrella with Mutsumi too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:01.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:06.02,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "with Mutsumi too"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:07.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it not possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:15.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.79,0:18:18.13,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:25.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that... you looked really sad the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:26.50,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:32.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When you were sharing an\Numbrella with another girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:36.44,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I wasn't really...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then why did you look so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:41.21,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:45.46,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize if I'm just meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:17.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted you to cheer up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:21.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:23.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:25.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please share an umbrella with Mutsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:28.39,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:29.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:36.33,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,I'd feel bad for the girl from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:45.81,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:49.45,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,S-Shut up! I said I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:51.53,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not dating that girl or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.73,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:20:01.43,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,She... forgot her umbrella, so I was just walking her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:09.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:13.11,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:13.88,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:25.56,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Ralph!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:26.72,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.61,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to get me soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:38.02,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,Give me some more room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:39.99,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Quit complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.72,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,It's so packed in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:43.18,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.69,Default,Mutsu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just stating the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:47.38,Default,Ralph,0000,0000,0000,,I can't help it. It's a small umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:50.66,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi doesn't look too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:53.44,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.30,0:20:56.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:20.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is strange, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.88,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,What's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:25.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There's more in the jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:30.00,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you heal her to collect konpeito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:36.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted her to cheer up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:44.40,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Either way, you were able to heal her broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:46.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.19,0:21:49.23,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,The proof is right there in the jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:52.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'm happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.85,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I fear for the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:07.10,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I just felt something...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.87,0:22:09.64,Default,Shu,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.13,0:22:14.57,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing, Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.50,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:24.28,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,You did pretty well this time, so I guess it wouldn't hurt to give you a good grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:26.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you all right, Ioryogi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.94,0:22:38.79,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,Do...ba...to...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:41.29,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,You get a zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:45.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's so mean, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:47.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You just said you'd give me a good grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:51.39,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,I'm always getting splashed with mud and ink and whatever because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:52.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:54.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The rain will wash it all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.20,Default,Io,0000,0000,0000,,The rain can't wash away my anger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:59.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:16.53,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(365,190)\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}...The Rain's Gift.
