Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:07.83,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:15.07,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:23.24,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.64,0:23:31.85,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.13,0:23:42.82,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.33,0:23:45.51,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:50.08,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If telling you "Thank you",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:54.05,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}or hearing "Thank you" just makes you smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:24:01.23,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}then doing those things will make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.61,0:24:05.85,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}And the{\fsp3}y{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}ll make you happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:14.68,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Do{\fsp1}n{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}t worry, w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:20.00,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}I{\fsp3}t{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}s mysterious as to why tears roll down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:27.82,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,1500)}even though {\fsp3}I{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}m happy.
